OL,3,AZelensky urges US and Musk to lift
OL,4,AStarlink restrictions and be on 'right
OL,5,Aside of history'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA crucial US satellite internet service
OL,8,Fis still operating too slowly and
OL,9,Faffecting Ukraine's ability to stop
OL,10,FRussian attacks, President Volodymyr
OL,11,FZelensky has said.
OL,13,F"We are counting on these restrictions
OL,14,Fbeing lifted. The protection of lives
OL,15,Fand Ukraine's energy infrastructure
OL,16,Fahead of winter directly depends on
OL,17,Fthis," he said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
